  "en": {
   "name": "The pond Marof",
   "subtitle": "near Mrzlo polje",
   "description": "The pond Marof is situated in Mrzlo polje above Jurklošter in unblemished nature. It is suitable for fishing of carps and predatory fish. There is a fishing lodge along the pond where you can strenghten yourselves with food or drink. On prior arrangement we organize events for larger groups. The pond is opened on Saturdays, Sundays and holidays."
  },
  "club": {
   "name": "Ribiška družina Laško",
