  "en": {
   "name": "The river Savinja",
   "subtitle": "600m downstream from the bicycle bridge in Tremerje to the road bridge in Zidani most",
   "description": "The whole district expands from the viaduct in Tremerje to the road bridge in Zidani most. The Savinja is very dynamic river and its stream varies a lot. It is rich in various fish species and offers a lot of fun to all the fishermen - especially while float fishing for cyprinids ."
  },
  "club": {
   "name": "Ribiška družina Laško",
   "url": "https://www.ribiskekarte.si/rd-lasko"
  },
  "description": "Celoten revir poteka od viadukta v Tremerjih do Cestnega mostu v Zidanem mostu. Savinja je zelo pestra in razgibana reka. Bogata je z veliko vrst rib in nudu ribičem obilo športnega užitka, še posebej pri lovu ciprinidov s plovcem. Znamenita posebnost revirja je ribolovni del ujemi in spusti, ki poteka skozi mesto Laško in je na njem urejena tudi tekmovalna trasa. Revir je kratek in izredno bogat z ribami.",
